    "title": "Stretch Of I&M Canal Between Ottawa And La Salle To Be Part Of America 250th Celebration - NewsBreak",
    "text": "3 hours ago You can help celebrate America's 250th birthday by helping get a copy of the Declaration of Independence from one coast to the other. The American Discovery Trail 250 Relay is a celebration of the 250th birthday of the United States. Baton carriers will take a copy of the Declaration of Independence from California to Delaware. The relay starts July 4th on the west coast and is set to wrap up on the east coast on Thanksgiving. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
